  "question": {
    "text": "The mean and variance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;observations are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn></math> respectively. If one observation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>14</mn></math> is omitted, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math> are respectively mean and variance of remaining <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math> observation, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;is equal to ________"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "37",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p>Mean and variance of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;observation is given as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>16</mn></math>&nbsp;respectively,</p><p>So using the formula of mean we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>S</mi><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>56</mn></math></p><p>Now if we remove&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>14</mn></math>&nbsp;sum will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>56</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>42</mn></math>&nbsp;and new mean will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>42</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p>Now using the formula of variance we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></munderover><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>14</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mstyle><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mover><mi>x</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></munderover><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>14</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mstyle><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></munderover><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>14</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mstyle><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></munderover><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>14</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>560</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></munderover><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>364</mn></math></p><p>Now, new variance&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></munderover><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>364</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>35</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence, the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>37</mn></math></p>"
  }
}